        "statement": "With socket-based load-balancing, Local Redirect Policies by default redirect traffic that policy-selected node-local backends send to the policy's frontend back to the node-local backends.",
        "remediation": "To keep backends' traffic to the frontend from being redirected, set skipRedirectFromBackend to true on the local redirect policies.",
        "severity": "medium"
