      "statement": "In Cilium 1.16, when Local Redirect Policy is used with socket-based load-balancing, traffic that the policy's own node-local backends send to its frontend is redirected back to the node-local backends by default. Setting spec.skipRedirectFromBackend to true on a CiliumLocalRedirectPolicy turns this off."
